@overheard teamjob
// Pillar 5 Step 3 (head writer W2): the crew talking while they work a team job (seat X passes flag team.on while
// they stand at their spots). Bubbles: 60 characters at most. A blank line ends a conversation.

== overheard
? pair:works+works flag:team.on
A: Who's got the spanner?
B: You have. It's in your hand.
A: So it is.   #funny

? pair:works+works flag:team.on
A: Last time we did this it took two hours.
B: Last time you brought the wrong cartridge.

? pair:works+works flag:team.on
A: My arms are going.
B: Two more minutes.
A: You said that two minutes ago.   #funny

? pair:works+works flag:team.on
A: Tea after this?
B: Tea after this.

? pair:works+works flag:team.on
A: Hear that? That's a happy recycler.
B: That's a recycler that's been turned off.   #funny

? pair:works+works flag:team.on
A: Mind your fingers.
B: Minding them. I like my fingers.

? pair:works+works flag:team.on
A: Nearly there.
B: Nearly there is my favourite place.

? pair:senior flag:team.on
A: Steady. Don't rush it.
B: I'm not rushing. I'm keen.
A: Same thing, in here.

? pair:works+works flag:team.on
A: Does anyone know a song for this?
B: No.
A: I'll make one up.
B: Please don't.   #funny

? pair:works+works flag:team.on
A: Is it seated?
B: It's seated.
A: Is it properly seated?
B: Ask me again and you can seat it.   #funny
